    <body>
Saya akan <segment id='1' features='eror;leksikal;kata;vrbs' state='active' correction='bercerita'>berbicara</segment> tentang <segment id='32' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='mi goreng'><segment id='31' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active' correction='mi' parent='32'>Mie</segment> Goreng</segment>. <segment id='34' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active' correction='mi'>Mie</segment> <segment id='33' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='goreng'>Goreng</segment> adalah makanan yang dibuat dengan menumis <segment id='2' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active' correction='mi'>mie</segment> dan dibumbui dengan kecap ikan atau bumbu <segment id='5' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adverbia;adv0' state='active' correction='Biasanya'>lainnya. Babi</segment> digunakan di Jepang, tetapi Indonesia adalah negara muslim. <segment id='35' features='eror;leksikal;kata;konjs' state='active' correction='Oleh karena itu'>Karena itu</segment>, udang digunakan. Sayuran mentah seperti mentimun dan tomat sering kali dimakan bersama. <segment id='3' features='eror;leksikal;ungkapan;ukps' state='active'>Seperti di Jepang, orang-orang di Indonesia makan <segment id='7' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active' correction='mi' parent='3'>mie</segment> goreng <segment id='8' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prepx' state='active' parent='3'><segment id='9' features='eror;gramatikal;konjungsi;konj0' state='active' correction='ketika' parent='8'>di</segment></segment> macet.</segment>
Saya sudah makan <segment id='18' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='mi goreng'><segment id='17' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active' correction='mi' parent='18'>Mie</segment> Goreng</segment> <segment id='10' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active' comment='Tidak perlu menggunakan tanda koma'><segment id='11' features='eror;gramatikal;konjungsi;konj0' state='active' correction='karena' parent='10'>berkali-kali, <segment id='12' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;pronx' state='active' parent='11'>itu</segment></segment></segment> enak sekali. <segment id='13' features='eror;gramatikal;kalimat;kalpen' state='active' correction='Nasi goreng terkenal di Jepang, tetapi mi goreng tidak setenar nasi goreng.'>Nasi goreng terkenal di Jepang.  <segment id='16' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active' comment='Hapus tanda koma' parent='13'>Tetapi, <segment id='20' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='mi goreng' parent='13'><segment id='19' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active' correction='mi' parent='20'>Mie</segment></segment> Goreng</segment> tidak setenar nasi goreng.</segment> Saya <segment id='38' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbafx' state='active' correction='merekomendasikan'>rekomendasi</segment> <segment id='22' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='mi goreng'><segment id='21' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active' correction='mi' parent='22'>Mie</segment> Goreng</segment>!
Cinta Jawa <segment id='23' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrb0' state='active' correction='adalah'>Cafe <segment id='24' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;ygx' state='active' parent='23'>yang</segment></segment> restoran <segment id='25' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;yg0' state='active'>Indonesia ada</segment> di Shibuya. <segment id='26' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adverbia;adv0' state='active' correction='dapat'>Anda <segment id='27' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nom0' state='active' correction='cita rasa'>menikmati</segment> <segment id='28' features='eror;leksikal;kata;adjs' state='active' correction='asli' parent='27'>nyata</segment></segment> <segment id='30' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='mi goreng'><segment id='29' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active' correction='mi' parent='30'>Mie</segment> Goreng</segment> di sana. Anda harus pergi dan mencobanya.    </body>
